    "https://stevenson.peopleadmin.com/postings/11265": {
      "title": "Stevenson University Applicant Portal | Student Assistant - Athletics Equipment",
      "description": "Stevenson University Applicant Portal | Student Assistant - Athletics Equipment Skip to Main Content Find Your Role:  We strive to achieve an environment and an atmosphere that supports, challenges, and inspires every individual on campus. Learn how the Stevenson Way makes this effort possible and how you can become part of a great place to work. Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Student Assistant - Athletics Equipment Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Description Posting Number 01108 Position Title Student Assistant - Athletics Equipment Department Athletics: Administrative Position Summary The Student Assistant– Athletics Equipment will provide assistance in three main areas of the equipment operation: inventory management, laundry operation, and distribution/collection of equipment.  With inventory management, the student will assist in counting, data entry, and storage of athletic equipment.  The Student Assistant – Athletics Equipment will assist in the laundering of athletic clothing and uniforms. Education/Experience Currently enrolled Stevenson University student in good standing with the University, both academically and judicially. Knowledge/Skills/Ability Ability to work nights and weekends Must have computer skills Highly organized Self-starter and able to complete tasks on their own Excellent communication skills Attention to detail Knowledge and interest in sports and athletics equipment/operations Enthusiastic with a desire to work hard and have fun Leadership skills Physical Requirements Light work: exerting up to 50 pounds of force occasionally and/or a negligible amount of force constantly to move objects. Keyboarding, standing and/or sitting, walking, talking and hearing. Close visual acuity to perform an activity such as viewing a computer terminal. Subject to both environmental conditions; activities occur inside and outside. Essential Functions Daily laundry of practice and game uniforms Inventory of athletic equipment Issuing of athletic equipment Collecting equipment from athletes after their season Game day set-up of uniforms for SU home contests Keeping all equipment rooms cleaned and organized Data entry on issued athletic equipment Reports To Equipment Manager Posting Information Number of Available Positions Varies based on need of the dept. Work Location Owings Mills Position Category Student Position Type Student Employee Months/Year 9 Hrs/Week Less than 20 Hrs/Year If scheduled to work less than 12 months, beginning date Ending Date FLSA Non-Exempt Payroll Biweekly Hiring Salary Range $15.00 per hour Benefits https://www.stevenson.edu/human-resources/benefits/ Recruitment Instructions Open to All Current Students Posting Date 06/17/2025 Closing Date/Application Deadline Open Until Filled No EEO Statement Stevenson University is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter/Letter of Application Other Document Stevenson University Main Campus 100 Campus Circle Owings Mills, MD, 21117-7804 1-877-468-6852 410-486-7001 Greenspring Campus 1525 Greenspring Valley Road Stevenson, MD, 21153-064 Maps & Directions Campus Map Join the Conversation Facebook Twitter Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Flickr Campus Resources News & Events Directory Campus Security & Parking SU Alert Employment SU Now Portal Mustang Athletics Give to Stevenson Stevenson University © 2017 Stevenson University Title IX Annual Security & Fire Safety Report Consumer Information Privacy Policy To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
