    "https://stevenson.peopleadmin.com/postings/9726": {
      "title": "Stevenson University Applicant Portal | Work Study – Assistant Nursing (Clinical)",
      "description": "Stevenson University Applicant Portal | Work Study – Assistant Nursing (Clinical) Skip to Main Content Find Your Role:  We strive to achieve an environment and an atmosphere that supports, challenges, and inspires every individual on campus. Learn how the Stevenson Way makes this effort possible and how you can become part of a great place to work. Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Work Study – Assistant Nursing (Clinical) Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Looking for a Federal Work Study Eligible student. Posting Details Position Description Posting Number 01052 Position Title Work Study – Assistant Nursing (Clinical) Department School of Nursing & Health Professions: Dean's Office Position Summary The Work Study – Assistant Nursing involves working in an administrative capacity to support the clinical operations of the Berman School of Nursing and Health Professions and the work of the Director of Clinical Practice and the Coordinator, Clinical Contracts and Compliance. Education/Experience Currently enrolled at Stevenson University and in good standing with the university both academically and judicially.  Administrative/clerical experience preferred.  Healthcare experience strongly preferred. Knowledge/Skills/Ability Knowledge of medical/healthcare terminology Computer and office software skills (i.e. Microsoft Office Suite) Physical Requirements Sedentary work with occasional need for medium work: Exerting up to 20 pounds of force occasionally and/or a negligible amount of force constantly to move objects. Sitting, standing, walking, talking, hearing, keyboarding, and repetitive motions. Close visual acuity. Subject to inside and outside environmental conditions, and an office location with potential exposure to science laboratories, chemicals and chemical processes, biologicals and biological processes and magnetic field. Essential Functions Assist with scheduling appointments for Academic Program Administrators (APAs), Clinical Placement Coordinator, and Director of Clinical Practice. Assist with planning clinical orientation and clinical supervisor meetings. Assist Course Coordinators with clinical management aspects of course coordination. Internally route non-confidential clinical contracts, documentation, and paperwork. Electronically and/or physically maintain non-confidential program clinical records. Schedule/re-schedule student dosage calculation exams. Assist with laboratory set-up and clean up. Verify students’ completion of clinical orientation/onboarding. Contact students regarding outstanding clinical documents, requirements, and/or deadlines. Develop/update Standard Operating Procedures (SoPs) for clinical management and submit for review. Communicate clinical scheduling, needs, issues, and changes to students, faculty, Course Coordinators, and Academic Program Administrators (APAs). Reports To Faculty Director, Clinical Practice Posting Information Number of Available Positions 2 Work Location Owings Mills North Position Category Student Position Type Student Work-Study Months/Year 9-12 Hrs/Week 10-20 Hrs/Year If scheduled to work less than 12 months, beginning date Ending Date FLSA Non-Exempt Payroll Biweekly Hiring Salary Range $15.00 per hour Benefits https://www.stevenson.edu/human-resources/benefits/ Recruitment Instructions Open to All Current Students Posting Date 11/14/2023 Closing Date/Application Deadline Open Until Filled No EEO Statement EOE /AA Employer of Minorities/Females/Veterans/Disability Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Resume Optional Documents Stevenson University Main Campus 100 Campus Circle Owings Mills, MD, 21117-7804 1-877-468-6852 410-486-7001 Greenspring Campus 1525 Greenspring Valley Road Stevenson, MD, 21153-064 Maps & Directions Campus Map Join the Conversation Facebook Twitter Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Flickr Campus Resources News & Events Directory Campus Security & Parking SU Alert Employment SU Now Portal Mustang Athletics Give to Stevenson Stevenson University © 2017 Stevenson University Title IX Annual Security & Fire Safety Report Consumer Information Privacy Policy To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
